OL,5,G1500 The Colours in Sound, with
OL,6,G     Caroline Shaw
OL,7,     FGrammy-award winning composer
OL,8,     FCaroline Shaw takes us on a
OL,9,     Fjourney through orchestration -
OL,10,     Fthe colours in sound. In this
OL,11,     Fepisode, she explores how
OL,12,     Fcomposers use the idea of space.
OL,13,G1600 Jazz Record Requests
OL,14,     FAlyn Shipton presents jazz records
OL,15,     Fof all styles as requested by you.
OL,16,G1700 The Early Music Show
OL,17,     FHannah French is joined by
OL,18,     Fconductor Graham Ross to explore
OL,19,     Fsome modern rediscoveries of
OL,20,     FPalestrina's music, 500 years
OL,21,     Fafter the composer's birth.
